<title>FINLAND: SAVON SANOMAT JAN-AUG PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>SAVON SANOMAT JAN-AUG PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items    16.9 vs 13.5</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    5.54 vs 4.48</p>
<p> Net sales				   121.0 vs 113.9</p>
<p>Operating profit before depreciation 26.2 vs 23.5</p>
<p> Depreciation				  7.6 vs 7.9</p>
<p> Operating profit			   18.6 vs 15.6</p>
<p> Net financial items		charge 1.7 vs 2.1 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 nil vs 1.3 gain</p>
<p> Profit before reserves, taxes	  16.9 vs 14.8</p>
<p> Taxes					   1.5 vs 1.1</p>
<p> Net profit				   15.4 vs 13.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish media group is Savon Sanomat Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0248</p>
</text>
